{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1065877/block/singleImage/3278891/df/1608699518_6o.jpg?updatedAt=1795675720\"/><figcaption>北大嶼山醫院。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>東涌發生懷疑猝死事件。 今日（26日）早上8時許，一名47歲女子於東涌迎康街1號「昇薈」10座家中暈倒，其丈夫發現後立即報警。警方和救援人員接報後趕至現場，由救護車將女子送往北大嶼山醫院搶救，可惜最終證實不治，死因有待驗屍確定。警方正在調查事件。據了解，女子有身體病患紀錄。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T07:42:52.335192+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":151,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T06:48:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T20:37:33.912777+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T07:36:12.705646+00:00","content_hash":"7f13320434c45aaf8457ae787323c7f8167fab2889052d9ced4f9c8d8e37d805","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T07:42:52.335192+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}